triage: fix_game: The scuttle and Jack scenarios crash inside the game's own bookkeeping: it reads `pile_ranks[target_index - 1]` from a list that does not hold the targeted card, so the lookup is out of range. The unparseable-reply scenario shows the game turning a bad reply into a DRAW (hand grew, draw pile shrank) when the rules say it counts as PASS and nothing changes. Both are faults in the file; the rules are clear and the platform can express them.
