triage: fix_game: In three end-of-game scenarios the file sets `won` = 1 for a player whose points (0) are below their threshold (30). So the start-of-turn win check, or an end-of-game step, writes `won` without the arithmetic condition. Separately, an unparseable reply was handled as DRAW (a card moved from the draw pile to the hand) instead of PASS.
